{"id":"ac2aa08793960241","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Cofinal Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence — ZFC Seq Cofinal Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence — ZFC Seq Cofinal Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence — ZFC Seq Cofinal Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j\\in V\">\\(s,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S(s,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(i\\in j\\to(s(i)\\in s(j)\\lor s(i)=s(j)))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\beta\\in s(i)\\lor\\beta=s(i))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S(s,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(i\\in j\\to(s(i)\\in s(j)\\lor s(i)=s(j)))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\beta\\in s(i)\\lor\\beta=s(i))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence is a typed nondecreasing function of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The non-strict cofinality clause correctly handles successor ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqCofinalSequence}_S(s,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(i\\in j\\to(s(i)\\in s(j)\\lor s(i)=s(j)))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\beta\\in s(i)\\lor\\beta=s(i))","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)","display":false}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-seq-cofinal-sequence]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","315ad00b8744fdfc","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}